  "releaseNotes": "Aligns LibreWPF with ProGPU preview.18; keeps menu, context-menu, ComboBox, and direct-popup pointer transfers interactive across native popup windows; synchronizes popup closure and native title chrome; enables runtime Aero, Aero2, AeroLite, Classic, Fluent, Luna, and Royale switching in the MVP sample; restores text selection, keyboard shortcuts, safe drag selection, and resize-time rendering; and retains the memory and glyph-atlas optimizations from preview.17.",
